    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.poster.avif?t=1733943186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.webm?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.mp4?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xukaackque plunges you into a nightmarish dream realm where you play as a ninja trapped in the dream of the monstrous spider, Xukaackque. Your ultimate goal: find the elusive portals that lead upwards, escaping this arachnid hell. But beware - each death drags you deeper into Xukaackque's twisted dreamscape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/3ec01237010515dee552dd31151e2d5d.poster.avif?t=1733943186\" width=500 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/3ec01237010515dee552dd31151e2d5d.webm?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Experimental Soundscape: Immerse yourself in a dark, ever-changing electro-spider music that amplifies the game's eerie atmosphere with specialized layered musical arrangements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent Spider AI: Arachnids use audible cues to communicate your position, creating a hivemind dynamic hunting ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Dash: Harness a powerful dash ability to crush spiders and swiftly traverse the environment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/1634108589d39b639f6cce68ce494ece.webp?t=1733943186\" width=61 height=62 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Shield: Deploy a magical barrier that repels spider attacks, adding a strategic defensive layer while being able to bounce off objects and glide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser Shuriken: Unleash deadly ninja stars that make precision shooting while on the move effortless like they have a mind of their own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/c47848f11bd16f940ad3fa5d1da2d0b1.webp?t=1733943186\" width=44 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming Swarms: Face terrifying hordes of spiders that push your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, Randomized World: Every playthrough offers a unique, sprawling landscape to navigate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you ascend from the depths of Xukaackque's mind, or will you become eternally entangled in this web of nightmares?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.poster.avif?t=1733943186\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.webm?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/b29d11e4c8f14e2eccce8de5a7ecbc83.mp4?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xukaackque plunges you into a nightmarish dream realm where you play as a ninja trapped in the dream of the monstrous spider, Xukaackque. Your ultimate goal: find the elusive portals that lead upwards, escaping this arachnid hell. But beware - each death drags you deeper into Xukaackque's twisted dreamscape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/3ec01237010515dee552dd31151e2d5d.poster.avif?t=1733943186\" width=500 height=474 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/3ec01237010515dee552dd31151e2d5d.webm?t=1733943186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Experimental Soundscape: Immerse yourself in a dark, ever-changing electro-spider music that amplifies the game's eerie atmosphere with specialized layered musical arrangements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intelligent Spider AI: Arachnids use audible cues to communicate your position, creating a hivemind dynamic hunting ground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ninja Dash: Harness a powerful dash ability to crush spiders and swiftly traverse the environment.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/1634108589d39b639f6cce68ce494ece.webp?t=1733943186\" width=61 height=62 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Shield: Deploy a magical barrier that repels spider attacks, adding a strategic defensive layer while being able to bounce off objects and glide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser Shuriken: Unleash deadly ninja stars that make precision shooting while on the move effortless like they have a mind of their own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252270/extras/c47848f11bd16f940ad3fa5d1da2d0b1.webp?t=1733943186\" width=44 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming Swarms: Face terrifying hordes of spiders that push your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, Randomized World: Every playthrough offers a unique, sprawling landscape to navigate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you ascend from the depths of Xukaackque's mind, or will you become eternally entangled in this web of nightmares?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "An experimental shooter where you play a ninja trapped in a spider's nightmarish realm. An imaginary landscape to escape with hellish spider guards. Will the world ever hear your story? Are you just another one that tripped, fell into a spider web in the basement, never to return?",
